d be served in order to  promote the objectives of prevention of  crime and disorder the prevention of  public nuisance Public Safety and the  protection of children from harm this  concludes the hearing thank you for  attending council notice will issue to  you by the licensing officers within the  next few days we are sympathetic to your  situation and suggest pursuit for future  applications it would be advisable to  seek guidance from the licensing team  thank you  [Music]
 

